					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					964
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τελεταί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					238
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγάλματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					451
				</span></i>
			 (troch.).</div>
